// M6 slice 45, the review (M516, M528, M529, M531; SEAM.md §§521 to 529).
// Built on slices 40 to 44's harness (reference.mjs, drive.mjs, check41.mjs,
// assets43.mjs, plan44.mjs) and pinned beside it:
//
// - owner-supplied evidence files of the five formats D7 A.2 names (png,
//   webp, jpeg, mp4, webm), each generated by the test with a valid header
//   and nothing else of an image or a recording (BS6 §4.1 rule 22): never a
//   real picture, never decoded, never played;
// - the owner's review commands through his production routes and the
//   `surety design review` and `surety design verdicts` commands in the
//   test's own home (rule 26), and a review-mode Designer session driven by
//   turns;
// - reads of `design_reviews`, `design_evidence`, findings and the review's
//   projections;
// - a Pantry carried to Alpha with no design approved (`at_alpha`, or `both`
//   with the design before build waived) for a first design at Alpha (M529);
//   a Pantry whose only target is `android` (M528 (g));
// - the design criterion and its check that M517 used (`state_marker_present`
//   on android, R3.2), and the delivery replan M517 wrote, for the replans
//   a review's change reaches (M529 (e));
// - the review at Alpha's own Pantry (M516): two more web screens whose
//   routes the engine fetches (one past `adapter_output_max_bytes`, one that
//   answers 404), and a server whose page carries a synthetic secret it
//   assembles at run time, so the redactor's part in the engine's fetch can
//   be read.
//
// Nothing here starts, stops or signals a process but the scripted roles and
// the engine's own commands in the test's home. Nothing the Designer or the
// owner wrote is run by anyone (BS6 §4.1 rule 21).

